### Quick Test to Verify Route Works
### Test a working endpoint first, then try the new one

### 1. First test a known working endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/lab-tests/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJsYWJhZG1pbmlkIiwiZW1haWwiOiJsYWJhZG1pbkBtYWlsLmNvbSIsInVzZXJUeXBlIjoibGFiYWRtaW4iLCJmaXJzdE5hbWUiOiJMYWIgVGVzdCIsImxhc3ROYW1lIjoiQWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3NjQzMTE2MzMsImV4cCI6MTc2NDM5ODAzM30.VmoQzpZ9H3Bw8Tc7cM5zeXlLLXaycr4PxTTBkJR6-9c

### 2. Now test the new endpoint - try with one of the order IDs from the response above
### Look at the response from step 1 and use an actual orderId from there
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/lab-test-orders/USE_ORDER_ID_FROM_ABOVE_RESPONSE
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJsYWJhZG1pbmlkIiwiZW1haWwiOiJsYWJhZG1pbkBtYWlsLmNvbSIsInVzZXJUeXBlIjoibGFiYWRtaW4iLCJmaXJzdE5hbWUiOiJMYWIgVGVzdCIsImxhc3ROYW1lIjoiQWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3NjQzMTE2MzMsImV4cCI6MTc2NDM5ODAzM30.VmoQzpZ9H3Bw8Tc7cM5zeXlLLXaycr4PxTTBkJR6-9c

